<div class="page-basic">
  <div class="page-basic__eyebrow">Policy</div>
  <h1 class="page-basic__title">Shipping Policy</h1>
  <div class="page-basic__body">
    <p>All orders are processed within 1–3 business days. Once your order has shipped, you will receive a confirmation email with tracking information.</p>

    <p><strong>Domestic Shipping (United States)</strong><br>
    Estimated delivery time is 3–7 business days from the date of shipment.</p>

    <p><strong>International Shipping</strong><br>
    Estimated delivery time is 7–14 business days from the date of shipment. Delivery times may vary depending on customs processing in the destination country, and HZRD is not responsible for delays caused by customs.</p>

    <p><strong>Lost, Stolen, or Delayed Packages</strong><br>
    HZRD is not responsible for lost, stolen, or delayed packages once they have been handed off to the shipping carrier. If your tracking shows your package as delivered but you have not received it, please contact the shipping carrier directly to file a claim. We are happy to assist where we can, but we cannot guarantee replacement or refund for packages confirmed as delivered by the carrier.</p>

    <p><strong>Incorrect Address</strong><br>
    Please double check your shipping address at checkout. HZRD is not responsible for packages delivered to an incorrect address provided by the customer.</p>

    <p>All products are shipped from the USA.</p>
  </div>
</div>

